{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ki7pvoozq0xtiz4k", "title": "41.Manus爆火带来的技术思考", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"raJxu\" id=\"raJxu\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0950fcd6\" id=\"u0950fcd6\">Manus</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ub18ab7d3\" id=\"ub18ab7d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40d98d75\" id=\"u40d98d75\">官网</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8b7e3421\" id=\"u8b7e3421\"><a href=\"https://manus.im/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf9775fe9\" id=\"uf9775fe9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc7841c23\" id=\"uc7841c23\">https://manus.im/</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1f7f97f7\" id=\"u1f7f97f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba381360\" id=\"uba381360\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7a016c70\" id=\"u7a016c70\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40954ccb\" id=\"u40954ccb\">1.要求设计一个AI驱动的rogue like的dnd规则游戏，实现脚手架 </span><a href=\"https://manus.im/share/CUIPWPqrbTKWrGkmf4bKRS?replay=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf472f5e5\" id=\"uf472f5e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1e5ffe9\" id=\"ud1e5ffe9\">https://manus.im/share/CUIPWPqrbTKWrGkmf4bKRS?replay=1</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u206cba63\" id=\"u206cba63\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda4beb50\" id=\"uda4beb50\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u373e5542\" id=\"u373e5542\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39b8954b\" id=\"u39b8954b\">2.要求实现一个微信群聊监控机器人，发现邀请码就快速打开页面填入 </span><a href=\"https://manus.im/share/flo3wfcTSDu8G3PbgUMahm?replay=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u71236275\" id=\"u71236275\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub49f99c9\" id=\"ub49f99c9\">https://manus.im/share/flo3wfcTSDu8G3PbgUMahm?replay=1</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u05dff5bf\" id=\"u05dff5bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f30093f\" id=\"u1f30093f\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u06e1fd41\" id=\"u06e1fd41\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc480670b\" id=\"uc480670b\">3.分析前几天AI + Toy浪潮的失败原因，给出当下生成式AI浪潮的差异，并且生成调研报告 </span><a href=\"https://manus.im/share/Qa9asdpYi6zcMSB4tIChdM?replay=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf69d2953\" id=\"uf69d2953\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3524a911\" id=\"u3524a911\">https://manus.im/share/Qa9asdpYi6zcMSB4tIChdM?replay=1</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucab94b6b\" id=\"ucab94b6b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c7703a7\" id=\"u1c7703a7\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4d836a49\" id=\"u4d836a49\"><span data-lake-id=\"u701ffca3\" id=\"u701ffca3\">4.于three.js实现人物骨骼动画控制系统，并且可以在多浏览器上运行 </span><a href=\"https://manus.im/share/dnvGsGOgAI5k9XUAX0q91s?replay=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uca1b4335\" id=\"uca1b4335\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4849eead\" id=\"u4849eead\">https://manus.im/share/dnvGsGOgAI5k9XUAX0q91s?replay=1</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d1a011f\" id=\"u9d1a011f\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"qMDiI\" id=\"qMDiI\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c5b40d8\" id=\"u5c5b40d8\" style=\"color: #333333\">智能体底层逻辑</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"fe12f13c4f950cc3e0f14a8acb5725af\" id=\"fe12f13c4f950cc3e0f14a8acb5725af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9871aca4\" id=\"u9871aca4\" style=\"color: #333333\">大模型可以帮我们做很多事情，例如回答问题、写周报&amp;文</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"c845d78735222f1ce1a2bb585f814086\" id=\"c845d78735222f1ce1a2bb585f814086\"><span data-lake-id=\"u071787cc\" id=\"u071787cc\" style=\"color: #333333\">档、内容总结、翻译等。但普通人和大模型直接交互是不现实的， 类GPT聊天机器人是大模型面向普通用户提供的一种接口，能够帮忙人们完成很多任务，但大模型能做的远不止于此，而聊天是一种泛化的场景，很多时候解决问题的效率不是很高。因此，这就需要</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"fd97dfdb5485fbaeb7398ac41a50dd1b\" id=\"fd97dfdb5485fbaeb7398ac41a50dd1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92fc30db\" id=\"u92fc30db\" style=\"color: #333333\">“智能体”登场了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"958a4f70b7c3065f8b30a27c45dfe2b7\" id=\"958a4f70b7c3065f8b30a27c45dfe2b7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e9331e4\" id=\"u0e9331e4\" style=\"color: #333333\">智能体（Agent）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4b8f7c78\" id=\"u4b8f7c78\" style=\"color: #333333\">是人工智能领域中的一个核心概念，指的是  具有智能的实体，能够感知其环境、通过学习和推理改变自身状 态，并采取行动以实现特定目标。智能体既可以是物理实体，如机器人，也可以是虚拟实体，如软件程序。它们能够自主活动并与环境交互，具备驻留性、反应性、社会性、主动性等特征，构成了一种能够持续自主发挥作用的计算实体。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"384ce10218d2aa732cd9c28b94820efc\" id=\"384ce10218d2aa732cd9c28b94820efc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf37a71a7\" id=\"uf37a71a7\" style=\"color: #333333\">想象一下科幻电影里的场景，一个机器人边工作边和人类对话，可以根据人类指令完成任务，还可以独自开飞船，维修设备， 甚至照看小孩等。可以将这种智能机器人视为一种智能体。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6caa50c9\" id=\"u6caa50c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2727093\" id=\"ub2727093\" style=\"color: #333333\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u63ecc065\" id=\"u63ecc065\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1741306820157-1986d4f8-f318-4edc-8053-e4d675200e9d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0cf12bd8-4ca5-4bb8-a0be-8e30450a172%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u20ffd76f-faad-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A775.1111111111111%2C%22height%22%3A402%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A176978%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1744%2C%22originHeight%22%3A904%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%BF%E7%94%9F%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%2C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A92%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A636%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A312%2C%22height%22%3A62%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E5%8D%95%E5%85%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A551%2C%22y%22%3A739%2C%22width%22%3A313%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84.%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A500%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text